Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?ChopGimp:=20options=20bar=20without=20scrolling?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20compact=20value=20fields,=20=C2=AB=20=E2=8B=AF?=
