MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- new ChopGimpValueField (app/widgets/chopgimp-value-field.c): label to
  drag (Shift = fine), typed value, wheel / Up / Down (Shift × 10),
  « ▾ » slider popover (gamma, scale limits, factor for %), units
- gimpoptionsbar.c: no GtkScrolledWindow; groups ("|") with separators,
  per-option priority; options that do not fit go into « ⋯ » (lowest
  priority first, back with hysteresis, computed in an idle after
  size-allocate); « ⚡ » holds Aperçu rapide / Rendu en arrière-plan;
  « Toutes les options de l'outil… » in « ⋯ »; wider font picker
- fixes flow shown × 100 (airbrush flow is already 0..100)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
